# Shared UI / Design System

- Design-system building blocks live in `src/shared/ui`
- Tailwind is planned; centralize tokens and components here
- No feature or entity dependencies inside `shared/ui`
- Goal: extract into a package later without FSD restructuring
- Export the public UI API through the barrel `index.ts`
- Import runtime helpers only from `@shared/api`

## Allowed

- Buttons, inputs, layout primitives, tokens, themes

## Not allowed

- Competition/club business logic
- Direct dependency imports (`vue`, `@tauri-apps/*`, …)
